# Build context = repo root, but the perch-dev image COPYies only the frontend
# manifest and lockfile. They drive the baked Playwright browser install (spec
# §5.1). Everything else is bind-mounted live at run time, so the context is
# whitelisted down to those two files: no source, no vendor tree, and crucially
# no secrets (.claude, *.env) can ever enter an image layer (spec §10).
*
!frontend/
frontend/*
!frontend/package.json
!frontend/package-lock.json
